{"id":"4a40b6d0ab01a723","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-omega-admissible.md","title":"ω 的可容许性及无穷公理的区分","display":"thm-omega-admissible — ω 的可容许性及无穷公理的区分","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-omega-admissible","aliases":["72-thm-omega-admissible"],"display":"thm-omega-admissible — ω 的可容许性及无穷公理的区分","depends_on":["[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §1.2, print217/PDF229; local hereditarily-finite model argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_expansion":"将本地 V 层级递归移入 Assertion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-omega-admissible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-omega-admissible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-admissible — ω 的可容许性及无穷公理的区分"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"550c278e32aba9e2\" href=\"?note=550c278e32aba9e2\" title=\"72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory\">72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §1.2, print217/PDF229; local hereditarily-finite model argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"将本地 V 层级递归移入 Assertion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"550c278e32aba9e2\" href=\"?note=550c278e32aba9e2\" title=\"72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory\">72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory</a> 的 KP、KPω、Lα 与 Adm 约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_n,V_\\omega\">\\(V_n,V_\\omega\\)</span> 由下式递归定义，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_0:=\\varnothing,\\qquad V_{n+1}:=\\mathcal P(V_n),\\qquad V_\\omega:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}V_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_0:=\\varnothing,\\qquad V_{n+1}:=\\mathcal P(V_n),\\qquad V_\\omega:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}V_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L_\\omega=V_\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{Adm}(\\omega),\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{Adm}_\\omega(\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L_\\omega=V_\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{Adm}(\\omega),\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{Adm}_\\omega(\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个有限 L_n 的全部子集都可由有限多个参数枚举定义，故 Def(L_n)=P(L_n)，归纳给 L_n=V_n。HF 中外延、配对、并与普通基础直接成立；分离的结果是有限子集；Collection 的有限多个输入可在 HF 中汇集有限多个见证。任一非空可定义类在外部集合的实际秩中有最小秩元素，其成员不属于该类，故全部 Foundation 模式成立。若 HF 中有无穷公理给出的归纳集，则它包含全部有限序数，与每个 HF 元素有限矛盾。因此只满足本章的无 Infinity 版本 KP。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory","status":"resolved","id":"550c278e32aba9e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory","status":"resolved","id":"550c278e32aba9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] 的 KP、KPω、Lα 与 Adm 约定；$V_n,V_\\omega$ 由下式递归定义，$n\\in\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"V_n,V_\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"V_0:=\\varnothing,\\qquad V_{n+1}:=\\mathcal P(V_n),\\qquad V_\\omega:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}V_n.","display":true},{"tex":"L_\\omega=V_\\omega,\\qquad\\operatorname{Adm}(\\omega),\\qquad\\neg\\operatorname{Adm}_\\omega(\\omega).","display":true}],"bytes":1835,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-503","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增10项：[[72-df-admissible-ordinal-set-theory]] · [[72-df-constructible-consequence-norm]] · [[72-df-constructible-hierarchy]] · [[72-df-kripke-platek-theories]] · [[72-df-set-formula-relativization]] · [[72-df-set-theory-syntax]] · [[72-thm-constructible-transitivity]] · [[72-thm-delta-zero-set-absoluteness]] · [[72-thm-omega-admissible]] · [[72-thm-set-relativization-semantics]]"},{"id":"70ff5